1.  Background & purpose
Today the portal sends a notification for each individual event — every vote cast, every comment left, and other activity — which produces a high volume of messages. To reduce that volume, notifications should instead be batched and delivered as a digest four times a day.
The digest times are fixed to Washington, DC time (US Eastern): 8:00 AM, 10:00 AM, 1:00 PM, and 5:00 PM. Each digest gathers the activity since the previous digest and sends it as a single, consolidated notification per user, rather than one message per event.
  E1  Batched notification digests 
Replace per-event notifications with a consolidated digest delivered four times a day at fixed Washington, DC times.
E1-S1  Deliver notifications as a digest four times a day
As a portal user who receives notifications,
I want notifications batched into a digest sent four times a day instead of one message per event,
so that I get a manageable summary of activity rather than a flood of individual notifications.
Acceptance criteria
●      Individual events (votes, comments, and other notifiable activity) no longer trigger an immediate one-off notification; they are accumulated for the next digest.
●      Digests are sent four times a day at 8:00 AM, 10:00 AM, 1:00 PM, and 5:00 PM Washington, DC time (US Eastern).
●      Digest times follow Washington, DC local time and adjust automatically for daylight saving (EST/EDT).
●      Each digest contains all of a user’s relevant activity since the previous digest, consolidated into a single notification.
●      The digest groups/summarizes the events (e.g., votes and comments) clearly so the user can see what happened and where.
●      A user with no new activity in a given window does not receive an empty digest.
●      Each event appears once — it is included in exactly one digest and not repeated in later ones.
●      Digest delivery runs automatically on schedule with no manual trigger; a missed/failed run is logged and can be retried without duplicating a user’s items.
●      These apply only to email notifications. In-app notifications need to be sent immediately.
 
End of request — OneVoice27 Proposal Portal, batched notification digests (4× daily).


